    "chunk_text": "Over the past year, our compatriots in Sri Lanka have worked hard in unity to realise shared dreams. The robust progress in China-Sri Lanka relations is inseparable from the dedicated efforts of our compatriots. Chinese companies have overcome difficulties and shouldered significant responsibilities, contributing to bilateral economic and trade cooperation. Chinese teachers and students have promoted Chinese culture and told China\u2019s stories well. Overseas Chinese have remained deeply connected to their roots, giving back to their homeland with sincerity and action. Everyone present here has played an important role in deepening exchanges and cooperation and enhancing the friendship between our two peoples. The Chinese Embassy in Sri Lanka has also actively implemented the vision of \u201cpeople-centred diplomacy\u201d, continuously improved the quality and efficiency of consular services, and made every effort to address the concerns of our compatriots. With dedication and compassion, we have worked to protect the legitimate rights and interests of Chinese institutions and citizens in Sri Lanka.\n\nAs the Golden Snake bids farewell to the old year, the Steed heralds a new spring. In Chinese culture, the horse symbolises perseverance, vitality and an indomitable spirit. Let us invigorate the pioneering spirit, muster our determination and drive, and turn our great vision into a splendid reality. In closing,\n\nMay our great motherland prosper and thrive, enjoying peace and tranquillity.\n\nMay the friendship between China and Sri Lanka endure and flourish through the ages.\n\nMay you all enjoy good health, smooth endeavours, family happiness and auspicious blessings in the Year of the Horse."
