    "description": "Protection of Occupation Bill impact on real estate market and bank collateral",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Protection-of-Occupation-Bill-impact-on-real-estate-market-and-bank-collateral/4-788168",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
